<BaseLayout title="VariantLens support — Help with Shopify variant images" description="Get help with VariantLens installation, product image assignments, theme compatibility, or your subscription."><header class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">VariantLens support</p><h1>How can we help?</h1><p>Get support with setup, assignments, storefront behaviour, theme compatibility, or billing.</p></div></header><section class="section"><div class="shell content"><h2>Contact support</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:support@variantlens.app">support@variantlens.app</a> with your Shopify store domain, the affected product URL, and a clear description of what you expected to happen.</p><h2>Before contacting us</h2><ul><li>Confirm VariantLens is enabled in your current published theme.</li><li>Save your latest image assignments.</li><li>Open the affected product in a private browser window.</li><li>Include the theme name and product URL when reporting a gallery issue.</li></ul><h2>Theme compatibility</h2><p>Shopify themes and custom product galleries vary. If VariantLens cannot safely integrate with your current theme, leave the existing gallery enabled and contact support so compatibility can be assessed.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>

